            "review_title": "Review at Phở Thìn by SOL",
            "review_text": "LaNyonsaise\nWest Midlands, United Kingdom1286 contributions\n0\nDidn’t order pho ….\nJan 2024 • Couples\nSeeking street food, our hotel concierge directed us to this street and we chose this place. Checking the menu it appeared to specialise in beef and snout to tail consumption. We chose “safe” options of stir fried beef, one in a sauce, the other drier. Both were fine, +/- 100k dong per dish, 29k per beer and 2k if you use the packaged wet towel left on the table with your order. Quick service from friendly young people, nothing to complain about.\nRead more\nWritten January 16, 2024",
